WEBVTT

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:26.030
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:26.790
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.110
Take them both to the treatment room.

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:36.360
Prepare them for dissection 
by the time I get there.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:37.860
Chaika!

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.740
And toss that one in the dungeon.

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.030
He can at least be Fayla food.

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:44.360
Toru...

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.090
Get in there!

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:49.710
Izhmash-sama.

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:55.270
It appears the intruders escaped 
because of Ursula's poor handling.

00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:57.090
I-I'm sorry!

00:01:57.960 --> 00:01:59.730
This is a good opportunity.

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.810
After we're finished with the 
Chaikas, we'll get rid of her.

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:05.930
Please wait! Ursula didn't 
do anything wrong!

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.390
All the escaped prisoners were caught!

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.520
There's no need to punish—

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:10.770
Same goes for you, Cyril.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:15.060
Once you've contributed cells 
for the mass-produced models,

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.400
there's no reason to keep you here.

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:21.530
All you demi-humans need to 
do is shut up and obey me.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.250
The Emperor's Fortune

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.590
Rude! Stop!

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:39.030
Rude! Not allow restraint!

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:40.360
Not allow touch!

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.360
Pervert!

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.850
Rude man! Rude! Rude!

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:46.790
Release now! Order! Release!

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.390
No touch!

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.180
Bullseye...

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:15.710
No debt.

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:17.310
Right.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.430
No close follow! Separate!

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.940
One exit. No choice.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.550
Cooperate, only now. Escape.

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:36.440
Rescue David, Selma... and other.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.330
Other... Toru?

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:39.690
Cooperate, only now!

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.070
Accept?

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.000
Accept.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:33.990
Not disturbed?

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:37.860
Chaika truth... Memories fake...

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.810
Shocking truth.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:40.630
Lies.

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.090
Decide truth, self.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:45.820
Chaika.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.170
Name?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.930
My name is Niva Lada.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.920
Niva...

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.060
Confined, restrained?

00:04:58.720 --> 00:04:59.940
I have waited for Chaika.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.690
Want come with?

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:04.470
Chance now.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:05.920
Leave quickly.

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:09.110
Can't abandon! Rescue!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.670
You stupid?!

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:15.390
Emergency now! Save others, no time!

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:18.460
Can't... abandon!

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:33.560
Release, success!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.100
Startup factor verified.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.300
Startup factor?

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.620
Urgent! Move now!

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:45.360
Right!

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:50.970
What is this?!

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:54.380
They escaped? They waste their time.

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:56.160
Lock down all the exits.

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:59.710
Release the demi-human troops and 
Orthros within the facility!

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:03.440
An alarm?

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:05.120
I wonder if something happened.

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:20.160
Their stronghold must be down here.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:23.370
I'm worried about Brother. I'm going in.

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.480
You just need it opened?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.930
Damn... Found out already?

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:45.510
Is Toru being held in here?

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:46.400
I don't know.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:53.500
Did you guys see my brother and Chaika?

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:54.990
Nope, haven't seen them.

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.670
Have you two seen our Chaika?

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:58.990
No.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:00.350
Hey...

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:03.440
Could you break down this door for us?

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.710
No time. Can't do it.

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:07.980
H-Hey! Hang on!

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:10.700
If you help us, we'll pay 
you back double someday!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:11.640
Hey!

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:16.810
Chaika...

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.400
So she has been here.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.600
Hey, what about this one?

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.630
You said you'd pay me back double, right?

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:29.150
Yeah.

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:31.140
I'll remember those words.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:36.350
Thank you.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.650
Climb fast! Hurry!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.540
Not only Fayla...

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.410
Demi-humans...

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:07.540
Duplicate... Mass produce?

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.850
Research, what purpose?

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.340
Understood? There are two girls!

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.460
They shouldn't be able to get far.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:17.180
Find them and bring them here at any cost!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.820
So the Chaikas got away?

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.640
I've gotta hurry...

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:37.000
Demi-humans...

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.220
Wait!

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:40.900
Are you friends of Chaika's?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.710
Please, get us out of here!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.400
You two? Why should we?

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:48.270
You could use someone to 
show you the way, right?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:53.250
If you guys cause a commotion, 
it increases our chance of surviving!

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.130
Please!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.030
I will stay here.

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:10.040
Inform me the moment you find them.

00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:16.680
Niva Lada is...

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:17.760
No...

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.780
Where has she gone?

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.490
It couldn't be...

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.230
Did the Chaikas take her?

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:39.640
Toru!

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.600
We've gotta run!

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:46.620
You okay?

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.480
Yes.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:49.080
And the other Chaika?

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:50.470
Of course.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.280
And, this is...

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:57.550
You tried to be a hero again?

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:00.470
Girl, confined! Could never abandon!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:02.200
I swear, you always do this...

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.000
Still no report?

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.680
No, sir. We're currently 
searching one area at a time.

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:07.670
We'll find the Chaikas soon.

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:11.500
I don't care about the Chaikas! 
Just get Niva Lada back!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.850
All the exits are sealed.

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.250
If we search every last corner...

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:16.370
Izhmash-sama!

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:19.060
The exit in corridor #6 has been destroyed!

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:19.970
What?!

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:22.550
Assume level 1 alert status.

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:26.180
Mobilize all demi-human soldiers 
and Fayla over the entire island

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.000
and recover Niva Lada!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:31.060
Kill anyone who interferes, 
no matter who they are!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.140
Yes, sir!

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:34.450
I will go to the tower and 
mobilize the Fayla myself.

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.640
I'll leave things here to you.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:39.650
Damn rats... There's nowhere for you to run.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:00.870
Unicorns?

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.970
And so many of them...

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.630
Looks like this is no simple island.

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.390
Hey, you've gotta be kidding!

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:17.660
If all the Fayla are released, 
we're done for!

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:20.300
Our only choice is to destroy 
their control source!

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:21.360
Control source?

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:23.170
Little punks!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.540
This way!

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:32.790
Hey, they're escaping outside!

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:35.860
What are the unicorns doing?!

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:37.140
Sorry about that.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.880
They looked dangerous, 
so we sealed the exit.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.530
I don't think they'll be getting 
out of there for a while.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.600
There she is! The princess!

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.500
Izhmash-sama?

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.110
Move. I'm taking over.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:02.070
I never thought they'd take Niva Lada.

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:06.670
I finally completed her after 
extracting elements from all Fayla.

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:09.750
She is what the emperor entrusted me with!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.580
I will find her at any cost!

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:16.660
Get down!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:22.090
Now's our chance! Run!

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:28.910
Damn! With that many Fayla 
bearing down on us,

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:30.350
we'll never outrun them!

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:43.740
Are you all right, Chaika?

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.200
Akari!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.300
Fredrica!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:48.830
Here you go.

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:52.290
Grateful!

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.160
That's...

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:00.370
Brother, they are our guides.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:01.240
What?

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.210
Does this mean

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:08.760
another young girl's purity has been 
tainted this night by my brother's wiles?

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.650
I'm disappointed in you, Brother!

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:12.310
I didn't bring her out here!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.860
Come, The Slugger!

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.430
Your defense is weak, Sticky!

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:27.930
Chaika Bohdan!

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:29.410
Chaika!

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:30.730
Catch!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:39.130
Grateful!

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.020
Don't stab me in the back 
the first chance you get.

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:50.550
Same to you.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.320
Damn it! There's no end to them!

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:00.990
It's dangerous in the forest!

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:03.330
There's a place up ahead with a better view!

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.690
All right! Let's run!

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:08.540
An observation tower?

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.790
Yes. It perpetually releases 
psychic waves across the

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.200
entire island through controlling magic.

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:16.730
There's a magic receptacle in the brains

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:19.530
of all the mass-produced beings, 
by which they

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:21.880
receive orders from the 
tower and act upon them.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:25.080
So they use that tower to control the Fayla?

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.510
Not just Fayla. Demi-humans, too.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:31.250
We were brought here from our 
homeland to contribute cells

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.970
to the mass-produced models.

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:36.830
But Izhmash disposed of the 
others of our kind, one by one.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:39.000
We're the only two left.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.260
Living weapons that act 
according to his will?

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:45.340
And this island is the factory 
where they're produced...

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:46.490
Pretty disgusting.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.240
Entire tower, most likely, Gundo.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.820
Amplify magic, high output.

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:57.250
Yes... I think the magic that conceals 
the island comes from there, too.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:00.300
So we just have to destroy 
that tower, right?

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:03.750
Questions later!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:05.250
Battle, prepare!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.430
Niva Lada... I've found you.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.550
Those damned thieves won't 
get away with this!

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.900
Chaika! Can you climb up this rock?

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:17.180
We'll take on the Fayla.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:22.180
You climb up and take out that 
tower with long-range magic!

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:23.690
Right!

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:26.260
Akari, back up Chaika!

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.120
Got it.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.080
N-Niva!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.420
Dangerous here!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.300
Beside me, stay close!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.630
Abt... Abt...

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.530
Kala... Silnicoba...

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.970
Come, take aim and destroy!

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:54.610
The Sniper!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:15:59.770
Defense magic...

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:01.810
She fired!

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.590
A waste of time.

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:05.190
I'll feed her to the Fayla!

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.820
There are too many...

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.210
This is bad!

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:24.330
No luck, Chaika?

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:26.340
Try again.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.330
Combat situation acknowledged.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:32.470
Startup conditions met.

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:34.620
Initiating operations test.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:38.220
Three of six seal spell layers removed.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.350
Switching to functional mode.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:52.940
Niva?

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:06.360
I am the Gundo Niva Lada.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:09.530
I am currently in magic 
fuel consumption mode.

00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:12.520
Niva... true form, Gundo?

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:13.310
Yes.

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:17.180
Possible. Can understand.

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:20.180
Niva Lada has activated!

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:24.940
I see... This is what the 
emperor wanted her to be!

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.420
Chaika! Are you all right?

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:30.160
No problem! No problem with me!

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:31.570
Final check complete.

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.480
Grant permission to begin spell?

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:36.240
Yes! Accept!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.280
Activating offensive magic.

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:45.960
Come, to ruin and eliminate!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.500
The Annihilator!

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:16.540
Niva...

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:22.660
I see...

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:27.690
So Chaika was the key to activating Niva...

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:33.750
The Chaikas coming to this island 
was part of the emperor's plan...

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:43.660
Are you guys staying here?

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.840
Yes. Izhmash is gone, anyway.

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:49.940
What about the Fayla and demi-humans?

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.940
Let them be and they'll die.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.540
They can't even feed if they 
don't receive orders to.

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:09.150
So, we came to this island 
and found no remains.

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:12.210
I don't think either of us 
can leave empty-handed!

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:16.520
Why did we come here?

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:17.090
Huh?

00:19:17.320 --> 00:19:20.000
Why did Guy send us here?

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:24.560
What if it was someone's plan 
to have us kill each other?

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:34.340
Well, no reason to go out 
of our way to fight here.

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.440
I'm sure we'll meet again.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:38.640
We found a boat back there.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:40.670
We'll be taking that home.

00:19:56.350 --> 00:20:00.760
Next, we'll discuss the martial arts 
tournament in the Principality of Hartgen.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:04.640
Is it true that the remains of 
Emperor Gaz are offered as a prize

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:08.470
to coerce participants 
into killing one another?

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:09.680
Kill one another?!

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:13.840
It's said that hundreds of the strongest 
fighters from across the continent

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:16.310
have taken up weapons and begun to assemble.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:19.210
There is suspicion that a 
military expansion is planned.

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.310
He wouldn't...

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:22.840
No, we have the precedent of Duke Gavarni.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:24.070
We mustn't be negligent.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:27.940
If we wish to act, it may indeed 
be wise to do so quickly.

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.850
We'll request that the tournament 
be called off immediately,

00:20:30.850 --> 00:20:33.300
and deploy the allied army 
if they don't comply...

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:34.500
Wait.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:37.390
What is it, General Fyodor?

00:20:37.390 --> 00:20:39.370
It seems a bit hasty to

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:42.240
use military force before 
confirming their true intentions.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:43.500
Then...

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:46.180
If remains are involved,

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.610
there may be some connection 
to the Chaika issue.

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:52.760
Why don't we have the Kliemann 
Organization investigate

00:20:52.760 --> 00:20:55.480
what's going on within the 
Principality of Hartgen first?

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:58.570
I'll take care of it.

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:08.120
Is Chaika all right?

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.190
Mind, confused.

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:19.280
I'm sure.

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:24.260
Memories... fortune... truth, fake...

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:25.780
Confused.

00:21:27.150 --> 00:21:29.470
Why don't you take some 
time to think about it?

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:32.760
It's okay to stay here 
until you find the answer.

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:36.520
Whether we continue to gather 
remains after that...

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:39.480
You can take time to 
think before you decide.

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.860
Yes. Grateful.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.610
You will gather the remains.

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:47.990
That is why Chaika exists.

00:21:50.220 --> 00:21:51.490
I have waited for you.

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:28.630
Captain Gillette was always pursuing Chaika.

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:33.070
I will continue where he left 
off and capture her myself.

00:23:33.720 --> 00:23:36.470
But what is the emperor's fortune?

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.980
The Castle of Madness

00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:39.570
Next time: "The Castle of Madness."
